# Node.js Web Server

## Project Overview

This project is created using the Node.js HTTP module. The main objective is to understand how a web server works and how different web pages can be served based on different routes.

The server handles multiple routes like Home, About, Contact and Services. It also displays a custom 404 page if the requested route does not exist.

---

## Features

* Created a web server using Node.js.
* Used the built-in HTTP module.
* Implemented routing for different pages.
* Displays Home, About, Contact and Services pages.
* Added a custom 404 error page.
* Used asynchronous file reading with `fs.readFile()`.
* Added CSS styling to all pages.
* Implemented proper HTTP status codes (200, 404 and 500).

---

## Technologies Used

* Node.js
* JavaScript
* HTML
* CSS

---

